376 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 137 0 R/T(The reviewed approaches address food sharing, demand forecasting, and resource distribution. However, these approaches may focus on individual aspects rather than combining all the required functions in one platform. Smart Donation Connect proposes an integrated approach that supports different donation categories, verified users, AI-based food demand prediction, intelligent donor\205receiver matching, location-based recommendations, real-time notifications, and donation tracking. This approach aims to improve donation coordination, reduce resource wastage, and help available resources reach genuine beneficiaries.)/E(The reviewed approaches address food sharing, demand forecasting, and resource distribution. However, these approaches may focus on individual aspects rather than combining all the required functions in one platform. Smart Donation Connect proposes an integrated approach that supports different donation categories, verified users, AI-based food demand prediction, intelligent donor\205receiver matching, location-based recommendations, real-time notifications, and donation tracking. This approach aims to improve donation coordination, reduce resource wastage, and help available resources reach genuine beneficiaries.)/Pg 23 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

