1092 0 obj
<</Title(4.2.5 INTELLIGENT DONOR\205BENEFICIARY MATCHING MODULE)/Dest[27 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 1096 0 R/Next 1090 0 R>>
endobj

1093 0 obj
<</Title(Abstract\204 Across millions of people in India are struggling to meet their daily needs even though surplus food, clothing, electronic devices, and other resources are available. Hotels, restaurants, event halls, businesses, and households often waste these resources, while orphanages, old-age homes, NGOs, poor families, and people in remote villages face shortages. This project proposes Smart Donation Connect, an AI-enabled web application that connects verified donors with verified beneficiaries across the country. The platform allows individuals, businesses, and organizations to donate surplus resources, while beneficiaries can register their requirements through a secure verification process. An AI-based food demand prediction model analyzes historical sales data, seasonal trends, festivals, weather conditions, and customer behavior to estimate food demand and potential surplus. An AI-powered recommendation system matches donors with suitable beneficiaries based on location, urgency, donation type, and requirements. Real-time notifications, verified user profiles, and transparent donation tracking help improve trust and efficiency. The proposed system aims to reduce resource wastage, encourage charitable participation, and promote social welfare and sustainable development.)/Dest[15 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1091 0 R/Next 1094 0 R>>
endobj

1094 0 obj
<</Title(Keywords\204 Artificial Intelligence, Web Development, Food Waste Prediction, Smart Donation Platform, Donation Matching, Resource Sharing, NGOs, Social Welfare, Real-Time Notifications, Sustainable Development.)/Dest[15 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1091 0 R/Prev 1093 0 R>>
endobj

