endobj

1137 0 obj
<</Title(This work relates to the use of machine learning for forecasting food demand and reducing bakery food waste. Demand forecasting can help businesses estimate the quantity of food required and identify potential surplus. Smart Donation Connect applies the idea of food demand prediction to its proposed platform, using historical food-related information and relevant patterns to estimate demand and possible surplus for donation.)/Dest[23 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 1139 0 R/Next 1135 0 R>>
endobj

