1139 0 obj
<</Title(3. Machine Learning-Based Demand Forecasting for Bakery Food Waste Reduction \(2024\))/Dest[23 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 1141 0 R/Next 1137 0 R>>
endobj

1140 0 obj
<</Title(DFD)/Dest[19 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 1138 0 R/Next 1142 0 R>>
endobj

1141 0 obj
<</Title(This study examines the use of food-sharing platforms by hospitality and food-service businesses. Hotels and restaurants may have surplus food that could be distributed to people in need instead of being wasted. Digital platforms can support the sharing process by connecting available food with potential recipients. Smart Donation Connect builds on this concept by including location-based matching, user verification, notifications, and donation tracking.)/Dest[23 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 1143 0 R/Next 1139 0 R>>
endobj

